        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Allie Goertz, Pamela Hayden, Matt Groening, Richard Nixon\n- Characters: Milhouse Van Houten\n- Works: The Simpsons\n- Platforms: YouTube\n- Topics: Satirical music, pop culture\n\nFacts:\n- Allison Beth \"Allie\" Goertz was born on March 2, 1991, and she is an American musician.\n- Allie Goertz is known for satirical songs based on pop culture topics.\n- Allie Goertz posts her videos on YouTube under the name Cossbysweater.\n- Milhouse Mussolini van Houten is a fictional character in the animated television series The Simpsons.\n- Pamela Hayden voices Milhouse Van Houten in The Simpsons.\n- Matt Groening created Milhouse Van Houten and named the character after President Richard Nixon's middle name.",
